  "steps": [
    "Heat ghee and sauté ginger, garlic, and green chilli.",
    "Add coriander powder, cumin powder, Kashmiri red chilli powder, black pepper powder, garam masala, Kitchen King masala, turmeric, and kasuri methi.",
    "Add a splash of water and cook until the masala is well roasted.",
    "Add boiled rajma, salt, and black salt. Cook well and mash until slightly chunky.",
    "Mix in fresh coriander, cool completely, and shape into balls.",
    "Mix all garlic dip ingredients together.",
    "Soak onion slices in chilled water for 10 minutes. Drain and toss with green chilli, coriander, salt, red chilli powder, and lemon juice.",
    "Place a rajma ball on a roti, press flat, and cook with butter from both sides until golden and crispy.",
    "Spread garlic dip, add onion salad, fold, and serve."
  ],
